  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of workers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILO will support the Azerbaijan Trade Union Confederation (AHIK) in development and adoption of a strategy on promotion of green jobs through integrated policies on just transition including in supply chains with strong emphasis on gender equality and non-discrimination in view of the COP 29 which will take place in Baku. ILO will also support AHIK&#x2019;s capacity in convening an international conference of trade unions.</narrative>
  </description>
